WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.092
The approach decomposes into three variants against
six baselines.

00:00:04.172 --> 00:00:08.833
DeepJointFeature, which adds clinical-presence
features to the joint model,

00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:13.131
improves over plain DeepJoint and matches a strong
feature baseline.

00:00:13.211 --> 00:00:18.631
The fine-tuned variant reaches the highest
population-level discrimination but overfits

00:00:18.711 --> 00:00:20.906
when the observation process shifts.

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:22.992
Across the robustness experiment,

00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:28.302
DeepJointFeature best combines strong
discrimination with proximity to the diagonal,

00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:31.020
transferring most reliably across settings.
